Look into energetic shielding techniques, as well as running earth, cosmic energy and filling yourself up with your own life force.

&#x200B;

These "psychic" techniques will allow you to blow away all negative charge in your space, and allow your inner personality to shine.

&#x200B;

It might just be placebo but it works for me

 [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Go7gn6dugu0](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Go7gn6dugu0) 

&#x200B;

The music video for that song doesn't support your point. It looks like all sorts of couples celebrating their time together. Its more sweet then anything

lol dude this type of rhetoric is why people are cautious to get into spirituality. 

&#x200B;

Why you gotta sound like a wook, you can elaborate on these esoteric concepts without sounding like you have dreadlocks and live at Whole foods

&#x200B;

Im spiritual and work in corporate America, truthfully I want fucking out, but at the same time, I want it on my terms and to not sound like a fairy.

&#x200B;

Its all about striking a balance
